    "versions": {
      "leb": [
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 12,
          "text": "Now these are the generations of Ishmael, the son of Abraham, that Hagar the Egyptian, the maidservant of Sarah, bore to Abraham.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 13,
          "text": "And these are the names of the sons of Ishmael, by their names according to their family records. The firstborn of Ishmael was Nebaioth, then Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 14,
          "text": "Mishma, Dumah, Massa,",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 15,
          "text": "Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 16,
          "text": "These are the sons of Ishmael, and these are their names by their villages and by their encampments—12 leaders according to their tribes.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 17,
          "text": "Now these are the years of the life of Ishmael: 137 years. And he passed away and died, and was gathered to his people.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 18,
          "text": "They settled from Havilah to Shur, which was opposite Egypt, going toward Asshur, opposite; he settled opposite all his brothers.",
          "isHeading": false
        }
      ],
      "nirv": [
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 12,
          "text": "The Sons of Ishmael\nHere is the story of Abraham’s son Ishmael. Hagar had Ishmael by Abraham. She was Sarah’s servant from Egypt.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 13,
          "text": "Here are the names of the sons of Ishmael. They are listed in the order they were born. Nebaioth was Ishmael’s oldest son. Then came Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 14,
          "text": "Mishma, Dumah, Massa,",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 15,
          "text": "Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish and Kedemah.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 16,
          "text": "All of them were Ishmael’s sons. They were rulers of 12 tribes. They all lived in their own settlements and camps.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 17,
          "text": "Ishmael lived a total of 137 years. Then he took his last breath and died. He joined the members of his family who had already died.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Gen",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 18,
          "text": "His children settled in the area between Havilah and Shur. It was near the eastern border of Egypt, as you go toward Asshur.\nIshmael’s children weren’t friendly toward any of the tribes that were related to them.",
          "isHeading": false
        }
      ],
